    "title": "Downtown Maryville prepares honorary banners ahead of Veteran's Day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JASON NEUBAUER ,\n17 hours ago Red, white and blue will wave with the wind in downtown Maryville from October through November on various light poles to celebrate local veterans. Downtown Maryville, a nonprofit focused on enhancing Maryville’s downtown area, has begun a project to honor individuals from Maryville and surrounding areas who have served in the military. Banners featuring various veterans will hang through Veteran’s Day Nov. 11. Read full article\n2",
